          0.1674
        ]
      },
      "assumption": "TF identity = tf_gene_indices from metadata; with no motif/perturbation information, direction rests on temporal precedence along the ASSUMED pseudotime orientation - if pseudotime direction were reversed, every inferred edge direction would reverse"
    }
